---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  pageTitle="Terms of Service | Pinellas Ice Co"
  metaDescription="Terms of service for pinellasiceco.com and Pinellas Ice Co service engagements."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="muted">Effective date: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container narrow legal">
      <h2>The website</h2>
      <p>
        pinellasiceco.com provides information about commercial ice machine
        repair, sales, leasing, and cleaning services, plus tools like the
        cost calculator and troubleshooting guide. The calculators and guides
        give honest planning ranges — they are estimates, not quotes, and not
        a promise of price or diagnosis. Actual pricing is confirmed in
        writing before work begins.
      </p>

      <h2>Requests and callbacks</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting a form or calling us is a request for contact, not a
        binding order. We (or a local service partner, as described in the
        <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>) will contact you about your
        request. Service engagements are governed by the written estimate or
        agreement you receive before work starts.
      </p>

      <h2>Service work</h2>
      <p>
        Scope, pricing, warranty terms for parts and labor, and scheduling
        are stated in the written estimate for each job. Manufacturer
        warranties belong to the manufacturer and follow their terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site — including the Pinellas County ice machine
        data study — is provided for general information. It's researched in
        good faith from public records, but it isn't legal, health-code, or
        engineering advice for your specific situation. Manufacturer names
        appear only to identify equipment we service; all trademarks belong
        to their owners.
      </p>

      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by Florida law, Pinellas Ice Co is
        not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from use of
        this website. Nothing here limits liability that cannot lawfully be
        limited.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida. Venue
        for any dispute is Pinellas County, Florida.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions:
        <a href="mailto:service@pinellasiceco.com">service@pinellasiceco.com</a>
        or <a href="tel:+17278556873">(727) 855-6873</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-top: var(--space-8); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
</style>
